{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 4, :comments ["<b>And I prayed</b> [ואתפללה], <b>please</b> [אנא] — like 'indeed,' and like its parallel: אנא ה' כי אני עבדך, אנא חטא העם הזה. And the Gaon [Saadia] said: for these are two words, and they are אל נא, from the root הואל, and the lamed is assimilated like the lamed of יוקח. And it is unnecessary."], :book :daniel, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 9, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["Ibn Ezra on Daniel - Daat" "http://www.daat.ac.il/he-il/tanach/parshanut_hamikra/full-text/eben-ezra/daniel"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T18:20:33.802349912Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}